OL,3,GNEWSA'My husband's one in a million
OL,4,Amedical condition doesn't even have a
OL,5,Aleaflet'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Ian Rawlins was first diagnosed
OL,8,Fwith a "one in a million" medical
OL,9,Fcondition, there was so little
OL,10,Fawareness of it that he and his wife
OL,11,Fcould not even read an NHS leaflet
OL,12,Fabout it.
OL,14,FIan, from Barnsley, and his wife Andrea
OL,15,Fstruggled to find out more information
OL,16,Fabout Stiff Person Syndrome (SPS) when
OL,17,Fhe was told he had the condition seven
OL,18,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
