OL,3,GNEWSA'My husband's one in a million
OL,4,Amedical condition doesn't even have a
OL,5,Aleaflet'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe extremely rare syndrome's most
OL,8,Ffamous sufferer is singer Celine Dion.
OL,9,FPatients like Ian are left "frozen like
OL,10,Fa statue", unable to see, speak or move
OL,11,Ffor hours at a time.
OL,13,FAndrea describes it as a "brutal and
OL,14,Fcatastrophic progressive condition"
OL,15,Fwhich causes excruciating muscle
OL,16,Fspasms.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
